[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0018","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0261","title":"NetManage Chameleon SMTPd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NetManage Chameleon SMTPd 服务存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于对 HELO 和 HELP 等 SMTP 命令输入长度缺乏有效边界检查。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标 SMTP 端口发送超长命令（如 HELO 后跟超过 471 字符的主机名），触发缓冲区溢出导致服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 Chameleon 4.5 及 UnixLink 97 版本，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0261"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:01Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Netmanage Chameleon 4.5 及 Unixlink 97 的 SMTPd 服务（Windows NT 平台），由于产品早已停止维护且厂商未发布补丁，建议升级迁移至受支持的 SMTP 服务器（如 Exchange Server、Postfix 等）。若暂时无法迁移，应在防火墙限制对 TCP 25 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接；同时监控 SMTP 服务的异常崩溃日志以及时发现攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.insecure.org/sploits/netmanage.chameleon.overflows.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0261.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0261","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0261.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0261.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0261.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9v5m-hg7x-6gfx/GHSA-9v5m-hg7x-6gfx.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0261.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2387/info.html","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0013","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0223","title":"Sun Solaris syslogd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统 syslogd 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，当远程主机向目标 Solaris 系统发送 syslog 消息时，若该主机缺少反向 DNS（PTR）记录，syslogd 在处理过程中会发生崩溃，导致系统日志服务中断。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，持续发送此类消息可使 syslogd 反复崩溃，影响系统日志记录功能。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0223"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:56Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 系统至包含此补丁的版本（如 Solaris 2.6 及以上），或在 /etc/syslog.conf 中禁用反向 DNS 解析功能；同时建议在防火墙层面限制外部主机向 UDP 514 端口发送 syslog 消息，防止未授权来源触发崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.Sun.COM/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?patchid=103291&collection=fpatches","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1878"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0012","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0222","title":"Cisco IOS Web Server 长URL拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 路由器的 Web 服务器组件存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标设备发送超长 URL 即可触发缓冲区溢出，导致 IOS 进程崩溃并迫使路由器重新启动，造成网络服务中断。该漏洞影响启用 HTTP 服务的 Cisco IOS 设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。缓解措施为禁用不必要的 HTTP 服务或通过访问控制列表限制来源 IP。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0222"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:56Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至修复版本（如 11.2(18)、12.0(11) 及以上），或禁用 HTTP 服务：全局配置模式下执行 `no ip http server`。如需保留 HTTP 服务，通过 `ip http access-class` 配合 ACL 限制可信管理源地址，并在接口上应用 `ip access-group` 过滤对 80 端口的非授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/60159","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8abbfc77cc703e2fd85623576b0f07a0c8427eb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0222.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0222","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/ce91429859b5110820b1d31a41b0b1a3c67d9603/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0222.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0222.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24ebb1752fdaa57c8d421b21085e47d359e1300e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0222.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0222.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8cfdaab2997679f3e193ea9539f778b75d8c9d41/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0012.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0012.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0011","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0221","title":"Lucent Ascend 路由器远程管理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Lucent Ascend 路由器远程管理服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标路由器的 150 端口（远程管理端口）发送特制数据包，导致路由器服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响 Lucent Ascend 系列路由器，无需身份认证即可远程触发，危害等级中危。官方已发布固件更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0221"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:56Z","remediation":"在防火墙或访问控制列表（ACL）中限制对 TCP/UDP 150 端口的访问，仅允许 trusted 管理 IP 连接。如无需远程管理功能，建议在路由器配置中禁用远程管理服务（no remote-management）。若设备仍在使用，应升级至供应商支持的最新固件版本，或替换为受支持的现代路由器设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0221","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0221.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8abbfc77cc703e2fd85623576b0f07a0c8427eb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0221.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0221","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/ce91429859b5110820b1d31a41b0b1a3c67d9603/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0221.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24ebb1752fdaa57c8d421b21085e47d359e1300e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0221.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-635x-qr4g-qqp3/GHSA-635x-qr4g-qqp3.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0221.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x81000/80896/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0111","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0438","title":"Ramp Networks WebRamp 1.0 UDP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ramp Networks WebRamp 1.0 设备存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标设备的 UDP 5353 端口发送特制恶意数据包，触发设备 IP 地址被异常修改，导致网络连接中断。该漏洞利用难度较低，仅需构造简单的 UDP 报文即可实现攻击，影响 WebRamp 全系版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0438"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-03-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"在防火墙上配置规则阻止外部来源对 UDP 5353 端口的访问，防止恶意 UDP 包篡改设备 IP 地址。由于 Ramp Networks 已被收购且该产品已停止维护，建议更换为仍在支持周期内的同类网络设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0438"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0088","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0431","title":"Linux Kernel 2.2.3 及更早版本 IP 分段处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.3 及更早版本的 IP 协议栈在处理分片数据包时存在缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可发送特制的零长度 IP 分片报文，导致目标系统内核在处理分片重组时出现异常，进而触发系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.1.89 至 2.2.16 版本，攻击者只需发送少量恶意分片数据包即可完成利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0431"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb","nvd"],"published":"1999-03-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复零长度 IP 分片导致的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法升级，可在防火墙上配置规则丢弃非法分片数据包作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0431","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0431","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0431.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6594-47rj-5vcw/GHSA-6594-47rj-5vcw.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0036","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0381","title":"Super Syslog 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Super 3.11.6 及之前版本的 syslog 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 syslog 发送超长日志消息触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Debian 2.0 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地账户才能利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0381"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-02-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 super 软件包至 3.12.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 syslog 函数中的缓冲区溢出问题。对于仍运行 Debian 2.0 的系统，建议升级至受支持的 Debian 发行版，因为 Debian 2.0 已停止安全支持多年。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 super 程序的执行权限，仅允许受信任的管理员用户使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/342","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.990225011801.12757A-100000%40eleet","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19270"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0156","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0156.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0483","title":"OpenBSD FFS和EXT2FS文件系统nlink值处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 的 FFS 和 EXT2FS 文件系统实现中存在拒绝服务漏洞。由于内核在处理文件 nlink 值（硬链接计数）时未做边界检查，当本地用户创建超过 65535 个硬链接时，nlink 值会溢出并触发内核崩溃，导致系统拒绝服务。攻击者需要本地 shell 权限即可利用，无需特殊权限。该漏洞影响早期版本的 OpenBSD 操作系统。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0483"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:29Z","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 2.5 或更高版本，或应用 2.4 errata 第 001 号（EXT2FS 补丁）和第 004 号（FFS link 补丁）源码补丁后重新编译内核。临时缓解措施可限制不可信用户的本地登录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6129"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0052","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0408","title":"Cobalt RaQ 微服务器 shell 历史记录文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cobalt RaQ 微型服务器存在信息泄露漏洞，当用户通过交互式 Shell 会话登录系统时，生成的会话历史文件（如 .bash_history）默认权限为世界可读，且位于 Web 服务器可访问的目录下。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 Web 服务器直接读取这些文件，获取敏感信息（如命令历史、密码等），进而可能导致服务器被完全控制。该漏洞影响 Cobalt RaQ 系列微型服务器产品。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0408"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:19Z","remediation":"修改 /etc/profile 或 /etc/bashrc 中的 umask 设置为 077，确保新建文件默认仅属主可读写。同时配置 Apache 的 &lt;FilesMatch&gt; 规则拒绝访问 .bash_history 等点号开头的隐藏文件，并清理已存在的历史文件权限为 600。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/337","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f4ffb7bcd93209aa53a757a7ebdf17fe2a18eb33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0408.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0408","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0408.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcb2bc8aed064ca80cf72b28e99ae813ae48a2c2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0408.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xx49-8f9w-5r74/GHSA-xx49-8f9w-5r74.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0408.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--79fb0f29-9144-486d-9073-fd90218349d6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0052.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0052.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0035","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0380","title":"SLMail 远程管理服务 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"SLMail 3.1 及 3.2 版本在启用远程管理服务（RAS）时存在不安全的文件访问漏洞。本地攻击者可将用户的 Finger 文件路径设置为指向任意目标文件，然后执行 finger 命令读取该文件内容，从而访问 NTFS 文件系统中的任意文件。该漏洞源于 SLMail 对 Finger 服务中文件路径处理不当，导致权限验证缺失，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0380"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:16Z","remediation":"升级 SLMail 至 4.0 或更新版本，该版本已修复 Finger File 路径遍历漏洞；如无法升级，禁用 Remote Administration Service (RAS) 组件，并限制本地用户对 Finger File 配置的写入权限。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 finger 服务或通过防火墙阻止 finger 端口 (79/TCP) 的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91996412724720&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91999015212415&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92110501504997&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/497","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5392"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1022","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1247","title":"HP HP-UX DCE/9000 摄像机组件本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 9.x 操作系统中 DCE/9000 环境的 HP Camera 组件存在权限提升漏洞，攻击者利用该漏洞可获取 root 权限。漏洞成因是 Camera 组件未正确限制权限访问，导致攻击者可通过特制请求提升至超级用户权限，完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1247"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:01Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 至 10.x 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可移除或禁用 HP DCE/9000 的 Camera 组件（执行 `/usr/sbin/swremove HP-Camera`），并限制本地用户对 DCE 服务的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/advisories/hpalert/006","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2061"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0157","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0157.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0484","title":"OpenBSD ping 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 的 ping 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 ICMP 请求包触发该漏洞，导致 ping 程序崩溃或潜在的任意代码执行。该漏洞影响早期版本的 OpenBSD 操作系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。由于该漏洞年代较早，建议升级至已修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0484"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:29Z","remediation":"升级至 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ping 命令的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议限制 ping 命令的 setuid 权限，仅允许信任用户执行。作为临时缓解措施，可通过防火墙限制 ICMP 流量来源以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6130"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0157.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0115","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0441","title":"Qbik WinGate Winsock Redirector Service 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qbik WinGate 3.0/Pro 4.0.1/Standard 4.0.1 的 Winsock 重定向服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的网络请求触发该漏洞，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WinGate 3.0、Pro 4.0.1 及 Standard 4.0.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0441"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-02-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:24Z","remediation":"升级 WinGate 至 4.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 Winsock 重定向服务中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可在防火墙中限制对 2080/TCP 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以降低远程攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.eeye.com/html/Research/Advisories/AD02221999.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/509","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19410","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/727cf5277c8c23eaf8725829e26aff2ea619a86c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0441.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0441","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0441.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/77fd3cf167afc5c82646a191836bcd2f9e51b459/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0441.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p997-7xm4-q2hh/GHSA-p997-7xm4-q2hh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0441.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0034","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0379","title":"Microsoft Taskpads 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft BackOffice Resource Kit 中的 Taskpads 组件将某些 COM 方法错误标记为\"对脚本安全\"，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，利用 Internet Explorer 中的脚本引擎调用这些危险方法，在用户系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98/NT 等系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0379"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:16Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-007 提供的补丁，该补丁会移除存在安全风险的 Taskpads 功能。受影响用户（安装了 Windows 98 Resource Kit、Windows 98 Resource Kit Sampler 或 BackOffice Resource Kit 第二版的用户）应通过 Microsoft Download Center 获取并安装对应补丁。如无法安装补丁，可手动删除 Taskpads 相关组件或避免在安装有上述 Resource Kit 的机器上浏览网页作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1019","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/498","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-007","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e927b0fe51353a8ed03f0466aad3c47ffd172da3/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0379","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0379.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8c57fab4f71bd6fdcec1202e5361e2a9805c4950/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0379.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vmvm-9v9v-pm58/GHSA-vmvm-9v9v-pm58.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0379.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/backoffice_resource_kit_cve.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000544.txt","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/windows.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0032","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0378","title":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall for Solaris 双GET请求病毒扫描绕过漏洞","description":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall for Solaris 存在病毒扫描绕过漏洞。当攻击者向受保护的 Web 服务器发送包含两个 GET 命令的单个 HTTP 请求时，该安全网关无法正确解析请求结构，导致第二个 GET 请求所指向的文件绕过病毒扫描直接通过。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞上传或传输包含恶意代码的文件，从而绕过安全检测机制，对目标系统造成潜在危害。该漏洞影响 InterScan VirusWall for Solaris 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0378"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:16Z","remediation":"升级 InterScan VirusWall 至 3.01 及以上版本，该版本已修复单 HTTP 请求中双 GET 命令绕过病毒扫描的问题。如无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器前部署反向代理或 WAF，过滤异常 HTTP 请求格式。该产品已停止支持，建议迁移至 Trend Micro 当前支持的网关安全产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6167","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e927b0fe51353a8ed03f0466aad3c47ffd172da3/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0378.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0378","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0378.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8c57fab4f71bd6fdcec1202e5361e2a9805c4950/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0378.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9fhp-rxc4-x67h/GHSA-9fhp-rxc4-x67h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0378.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82471/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000543.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0032.toml"}]